{"4152890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ordy: The Rise of Clara", "steam_appid": 4152890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ordy: The Rise of Clara</strong> is a single-player action RPG that puts you in the shoes of Clara, a young woman who loses her supernatural powers in an accident. Once a gifted individual, she is now an &quot;ordy,&quot; forced to navigate a world that is redesigned for the super-powered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clara dies in the accident, but is resurrected by a necromancer. She awakens to a new reality where her abilities are lost, and now she has to live in the Ordy District, a place that is safe for ordies. There, she begins to uncover a sinister conspiracy orchestrated by NeatAid Corp, a corporation that is secretly exploiting the powerless for its own dark ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of discovery, resilience, and rebellion. With the help of her therapist Jane and the former NeatAid Corp. scientist Dr. Reynolds, Clara must learn to fight back with her wits and courage.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ordy: The Rise of Clara</strong> is a single-player action RPG that puts you in the shoes of Clara, a young woman who loses her supernatural powers in an accident. Once a gifted individual, she is now an &quot;ordy,&quot; forced to navigate a world that is redesigned for the super-powered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clara dies in the accident, but is resurrected by a necromancer. She awakens to a new reality where her abilities are lost, and now she has to live in the Ordy District, a place that is safe for ordies. There, she begins to uncover a sinister conspiracy orchestrated by NeatAid Corp, a corporation that is secretly exploiting the powerless for its own dark ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of discovery, resilience, and rebellion. With the help of her therapist Jane and the former NeatAid Corp. scientist Dr. Reynolds, Clara must learn to fight back with her wits and courage.</p>", "short_description": "Imagine a near-future world where the supernatural is the norm. People effortlessly levitate, communicate telepathically, and use telekinesis daily. You play as Clara, an &quot;Ordy&quot; who lost all her abilities in an accident. How do you navigate a world completely unsuited for ordinary people?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152890/29240b560681bc9989ea4347970354195c88c7e1/header.jpg?t=1764651489", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152890/f692808859815f8104d52665ead65ee315fe5902/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764651489", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152890/f692808859815f8104d52665ead65ee315fe5902/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764651489", "website": "http://1eu-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570K / AMD FX-8310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 780<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790 / AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<